{
  "name": "HL · Supplier prices → Sheet",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HL · Supplier prices → Sheet (Lesson 3.4)\nEvery morning at 07:00: fetch the whole product list from DummyJSON (practice stand-in for Agro Depot), every page, then one row per product in Supplier prices, updated in place by sku.\n\n**No API key needed** for DummyJSON. For a real supplier, set Authentication to a Header Auth credential (never type the key into a header field) and delete any Authorization header that came in with Import cURL.\n\n**Credential:** Google Sheets (OAuth2) in the last node.\n**Placeholder:** YOUR_SHEET_ID (tab Supplier prices: sku · name · price · stock · category · fetched_at).",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 420
      },
      "id": "106bb5ab-e5fc-41f9-94e9-09e8b7cff4b2",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -484,
        -180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "daysInterval": 1,
              "triggerAtHour": 7,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ea954b30-131c-4b23-8b0f-be8ed2590fc3",
      "name": "Schedule Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://dummyjson.com/products",
        "sendQuery": true,
        "queryParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "limit",
              "value": "50"
            },
            {
              "name": "select",
              "value": "title,price,stock,category"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "pagination": {
            "pagination": {
              "paginationMode": "updateAParameterInEachRequest",
              "parameters": {
                "parameters": [
                  {
                    "type": "qs",
                    "name": "skip",
                    "value": "={{ $pageCount * 50 }}"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "paginationCompleteWhen": "other",
              "completeExpression": "={{ $response.body.products.length < 50 }}",
              "limitPagesFetched": true,
              "maxRequests": 20,
              "requestInterval": 500
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "f30b3751-2c27-42f5-9b72-713f975f40fd",
      "name": "HTTP Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 2000
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "products",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "7ab266d4-7d65-475e-b01c-ecf12ea2a21f",
      "name": "Split Out",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        440,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "manual",
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "4b3d384a-65d4-4a2f-a576-226abd205d62",
              "name": "sku",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "c61bb9dd-efeb-4dec-b600-e865acfd9dca",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "03ef818c-8089-4590-8fe1-ea78ca1b4cfe",
              "name": "price",
              "value": "={{ $json.price }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "6e070c63-3ee7-4616-9dc1-e5b942072ddc",
              "name": "stock",
              "value": "={{ $json.stock }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "99e23c34-08df-434f-86d0-c36d78456e88",
              "name": "category",
              "value": "={{ $json.category }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "53801120-fb92-459a-9a4d-fca5025fa384",
              "name": "fetched_at",
              "value": "={{ $now.toISO() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "58c62940-b901-4238-b611-bb2a8383ad76",
      "name": "Edit Fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        660,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "appendOrUpdate",
