    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## HTTP Request settings\nQuery: limit=50, select=title,price,stock,category. No skip here: pagination adds it.\nOptions → Pagination:\n- Update a Parameter in Each Request · Query · skip = expression $pageCount * 50\n- Complete when Other, expression: $response.body.products.length < 50\n- Limit Pages Fetched: 20 · Interval 500 ms\nSettings: Retry On Fail, 3 tries, 2,000 ms.\n\nAppend or Update on **sku** means a second run updates the same rows instead of adding more.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "79c35671-c890-4c0e-b954-66f241ab7994",
